    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "发号服务：拒绝 & 降级事件",
      "description": "devops-id 服务端发号故障事件速率（正常应恒为 0）：拒绝/s（红，idgen_requests_rejected_total）是业务 500 的直接上游；本地降级/s（橙，idgen_fallback_total）= etcd 不可用降级本地槽位，有重复 ID 风险；lease 失效/s（紫，idgen_lease_lost_total）= 槽位可能被抢占、发号已熔断；时钟回拨/s（黄，idgen_clock_rollback_total）。任一条脱离 0 立即结合健康状态面板与 devops-id 日志定位",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 96
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "拒绝/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "本地降级/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "lease 失效/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "时钟回拨/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
