      "id": 27,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "发号服务：健康状态",
      "description": "idgen_health_state（biz_tag 维度）：0=serving（正常发号）、1=degraded（降级：本地 fallback 或水位持久化连续失败）、2=not_serving（lease 失效/已关闭，发号被拒）。跳到 1/2 时用户写路径开始受影响。曲线在首次取号（懒初始化）后出现",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 104
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "idgen_health_state{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{biz_tag}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "发号服务端：延迟分位 P95 / P99",
      "description": "idgen_batch_latency_seconds（devops-id 进程内 Next/BatchNext 端到端耗时，按 method 维度）：P95=黄、P99=红。与「发号补充延迟」（调用方视角）对照可分离网络开销；与领域层基准对照（单号热路径 ~427ns、批量摊销后 ~2.4M ids/s 天花板）可判断是发号本身变慢还是被 gRPC/批量大小拖慢",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 104
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "P95.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "P99.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(idgen_batch_latency_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (le, method))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 {{method}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(idgen_batch_latency_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (le, method))",
          "legendFormat": "P99 {{method}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
